      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "High-end painted anime key visual. Refine the approved framing and objects of reference 1. Let planes of color model the forms. Selective fine colored contours lose and find their edges in the light. Let highlights break across overlapping forms, use delicate reflected color in shadow, varied satin and matte surfaces, intentional close details and atmospheric separation. Avoid uniform black outlines, flat sticker-like shapes and repeated hatching. Keep all requested local colors. Repaint the provided layout, preserving the subjects, poses and palette. Japanese anime key visual, clean tapered linework with varied line weight. Group fine strokes into readable forms, picking out a few crisp accents at the focal point. Model materials with deliberate shadow shapes, controlled highlights and restrained reflected light. Keep requested local colors identifiable in light and shadow. Maintain a clear value hierarchy and quieter distant edges. Follow the scene lighting and palette in the brief."
      ]
    },
